      "answer": "Kimetsu no Yaiba (\u9b3c\u6ec5\u306e\u5203) is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Koyoharu Gotouge. It ran in Shueisha\u2019s Weekly Sh\u014dnen Jump from February\u202f2016 to May\u202f2020, comprising 207 chapters collected in 23 tank\u014dbon volumes. The story follows Tanjiro Kamado, a coal\u2011seller\u2019s son whose family is slaughtered by demons, and his sister Nezuko, who becomes a demon. The setting is Taisho\u2011era Japan. The series was adapted into a 26\u2011episode anime first season in 2019, followed by a second season in 2021\u20132022, a third season in 2023, and a fourth season in 2024. It also spawned a feature film, several video games, and fanbooks.",
